# MikuNime — Security Findings Summary

**Target**: `com.mikunime.app.id` v0.3.0
**Stack**: Laravel 10 (debug ON) / nginx 1.22.1 / Express (MikuPay) / Firebase `komen-1ee45` / Pusher / Cloudflare
**Date**: 2026-09-09
**Platform**: Android APK + Web API

---

## Critical / High

| # | Vulnerability | Severity | Endpoint | Impact |
|---|--------------|----------|----------|--------|
| MK-17 | HMAC Master Key Leaked in APK | **CRITICAL** | Static (libmiku.so) | Key `MikuSecureV3_YanzzMasterKey2026_UltraGuard` embedded in native lib, allows request signing forgery |
| MK-10 | IDOR — User Profile by UID | **HIGH** | `GET /api/user/profile/{uid}` | Read any user's full profile: username, role, badges, mikuPoint, VIP status, avatar, banner |
| MK-11 | IDOR — Inventory by UID | **HIGH** | `GET /api/miku/7/9/inventory/user/{uid}` | Read any user's badge/banner/frame inventory |
| MK-04 | Wildcard CORS `*` | **HIGH** | All endpoints | `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` on every response — any origin can read API data |
| MK-03 | Profile Photo/Banner URL Injection | **HIGH** | `PATCH /api/me/profile` | Set any URL as avatar/banner (persisted) — used by Owner to serve GitHub-hosted avatars |

---

## Medium

| # | Vulnerability | Severity | Detail |
|---|--------------|----------|--------|
| MK-12 | Public GitHub Avatar Repo | **MEDIUM** | `github.com/teshotteshot-create/Miku` — 254 user photos, public read, 212MB |
| MK-16 | Payment Gateway Exposed | **MEDIUM** | `pay.mikunime.eu.cc` — 131 active orders, wildcard CORS, Express + nginx |
| MK-06 | Unauthenticated System Status | **MEDIUM** | `GET /api/system/status` returns maintenance config, server time |
| MK-02 | Leaderboard UID Oracle | **MEDIUM** | 3 leaderboards (xp/collector/donator) expose all Firebase UIDs — 31 unique UIDs extracted |

---

## Low / Info

| # | Vulnerability | Severity | Detail |
|---|--------------|----------|--------|
| MK-13 | Scraper Layer Unauthenticated | **LOW** | 8 endpoints no auth: search, detail, stream, ongoing, genre, jadwal, rilisan-terbaru, paling-popular, hot-hari-ini |
| MK-14 | Internal Source IDs Leaked | **LOW** | `detail.php` response includes `raw_source` with internal IDs, view counts |
| MK-15 | Stream Anti-Mod Rate Limit | **INFO** | `stream.php` returns `WAIT_REQUIRED` with 20s cooldown |
| MK-08 | Laravel Debug Mode ON | **INFO** | Full stack traces returned on errors |
| MK-09 | HMAC Signing Headers Client-Side | **INFO** | `X-Miku-Signature`, `X-Miku-Timestamp`, `X-Miku-Nonce` all generated in-app |

---

## Attack Chain

```
Leaderboard (31 UIDs) → IDOR /api/user/profile/{uid} → Who is Owner/Moderator
    ↓
GitHub repo → Download any user's avatar photo
    ↓
Inventory IDOR → See who has rare items
    ↓
PICK A TARGET → Social engineering using known username/role/avatar
```

---

## Full API Surface (69 requests captured)

### Authenticated (Bearer + HMAC)

| Endpoint | Method | Data Returned |
|----------|--------|--------------|
| `/api/miku/7/9/me/profile` | GET | Full profile WITH email |
| `/api/me/profile` | PATCH | Update username/photo/banner |
| `/api/miku/7/9/history?limit=N` | GET | Watch history |
| `/api/miku/7/9/bookmarks?limit=N` | GET | Saved anime |
| `/api/miku/7/9/global-chats?last_id=N` | GET | Global chat messages |
| `/api/miku/7/9/leaderboard?type=xp` | GET | XP leaderboard (all UIDs) |
| `/api/miku/7/9/leaderboard?type=collector` | GET | Collector leaderboard |
| `/api/miku/7/9/leaderboard?type=donator` | GET | Donator leaderboard |
| `/api/miku/7/9/notifications/unread-count` | GET | Unread count |
| `/api/miku/7/9/inventory/user/{uid}` | GET | User inventory |

### Public (no auth)

| Endpoint | Method | Data Returned |
|----------|--------|--------------|
| `/api/user/profile/{uid}` | GET | Public profile (no email) |
| `/api/system/status` | GET | Server status |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/search.php?q=` | GET | Anime search |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/detail.php?source_id=` | GET | Anime detail + episodes |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/stream.php?source_id=&episode=` | GET | Stream URLs |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/rilisan-terbaru.php` | GET | Latest releases |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/paling-popular.php` | GET | Most popular |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/hot-hari-ini.php` | GET | Today's hot |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/jadwal.php` | GET | Schedule |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/ongoing.php` | GET | Ongoing anime |
| `/api/v1/v2/2/3/genre.php` | GET | Genre list |

