## Headers Required for Auth

```
Authorization: Bearer <miku_xxx token>
X-Miku-Auth: vps
X-Miku-Signature: <HMAC-SHA256>
X-Miku-Timestamp: <unix epoch>
X-Miku-Nonce: <random hex 16 chars>
X-Miku-Device-Id: <device fingerprint>
X-Miku-Device-Model: <device model>
X-Miku-Brand: <brand>
X-Miku-OS-Version: <android version>
User-Agent: MikuNime/0.3.0
```

---

## What Works / What Doesn't

| Action | Works? | Detail |
|--------|--------|--------|
| Read any user profile | YES | `/api/user/profile/{uid}` — no email though |
| Read own email | YES | `/api/miku/7/9/me/profile` |
| Read any inventory | YES | `/api/miku/7/9/inventory/user/{uid}` |
| Enum all users | YES | Leaderboard (no limit) → 31 UIDs |
| Forge HMAC requests | NO | Server rejected — signing format unknown |
| Get other users' emails | NO | IDOR endpoint doesn't return email |
| Access Firebase | NO | `komen-1ee45` locked down |
| Bypass stream anti-mod | NO | 20s cooldown enforced server-side |
| SQLi on search | NO | Parameterized queries — safe |
| Mass-assign admin | NO | Server whitelists updateable fields |

